# Consecrate Land enchants a land (not a Mox) and gives it indestructible: Bot2's Stone Rain on it resolves and leaves the
# Plains (CR 702.12b, ruling 2005-04-01). When Bot2 then destroys the Aura with Disenchant, the grant ends with it (CR 611.3a)
# and a second Stone Rain destroys the Plains. Bot2's five Moxen pay for Disenchant {1}{W} and Stone Rain {2}{R} in one turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Consecrate Land
Mox Pearl
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Stone Rain
Stone Rain
Disenchant
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Consecrate Land.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Hand.Consecrate Land.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Keywords = Indestructible
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
